    "prompt": "Port $Q$ is 45 nautical miles from port $P$ on a bearing of $055^{\\circ}\\mathrm{T}$.\nPort $R$ is 65 nautical miles from port $P$, and $\\angle PQR=90^{\\circ}$.",
